  "unit": "NGN/kg",
  "about": "Market prices for the crops AgLens values on farms, per kg of the form the farmer sells. Not farm-gate prices: no regular source publishes those, so a harvest valued with these is what it would fetch in a market. Only real, dated observations are used; a price older than max_age_days is dropped.",
